{
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I suppose you won't believe in",
                "what I have to say, will you?"
            ]
        },
        "158_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's really there, in the recesses.",
                "You should see it for yourself."
            ]
        },
        "282_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A monster consumed by information!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who are you?"
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heard Sanae went into the pyramid",
                "and had a rough time."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If someone like her got taken down,",
                "the enemy must be no joke."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was right, it's definitely more intense",
                "than last time I was here."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A human, again?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, a different one",
                "from last time."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am the one who knows all."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Here, I touched the truth of the world,",
                "and so I awakened."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...Okay?"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "For some reason, the human from before",
                "just laughed and ran away."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But I'm sure someone like you",
                "can share my worldview."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ahh, so when Sanae said she had a rough time,",
                "it wasn't from fighting, but from this..."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not forcing you, but..."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Those who turn their eyes from",
                "the truth have no future."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you too wish to have free will..."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then bathe in my truth and stand as a comrade",
                "against the forces of darkness, the <i$deep state>!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How's that!",
                "I won!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No way, I can't believe",
                "the truth was defeated..."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wow, Sanae was right.",
                "This was terrible."
            ]
        },
        "178_0": {
            "lines": [
                "C'mon, let's escape to",
                "the surface together!"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So this is the \"monster consumed by information\"",
                "that Yuiman mentioned earlier..."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "\"Consumed by information\"?"
            ]
        },
        "170_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The only truth is your own experience.",
                "Nothing more, nothing less."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You see, Yuiman told me this."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The pyramid's information is deadly to youkai,",
                "but it can also give birth to new ones."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Either way, it's harmful to Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "162_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Unbelievable. And you're the one",
                "preaching about the truth of this world?"
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Harmful?"
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But, the surface is, well..."
            ]
        },
        "146_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The thing is,",
                "I'm just a fossil from this place."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's true that I was born here...",
                "but am I really harmful?"
            ]
        },
        "154_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What I wanted to say is,",
                "I've never been outside before, so..."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Beats me. It's just something that weirdo said.",
                "You don't have to take her word for it."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You should escape to",
                "the surface right now."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But if you stay here, your way of thinking",
                "might become warped beyond repair."
            ]
        }
    }
}